<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">EVERY DAY, A LITTLE MORE JOY</view
  ><view class="heading">签到攒金币，惊喜每天有。</view
  ><view class="muted">签到、红包群、宝箱和福袋，都在这里。</view
  ><view class="notice">开发联调 · 广告为显式模拟，金币不可兑现。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load"
    >{{error}} · 点击重试</view
  ><block wx:if="{{user}}"
    ><view class="hero" bindtap="wallet"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text>我的金币</text><text class="pill">开发账户</text></view
      ><view class="balance"
        >{{user.balance}}<text class="balance-unit">金币</text></view
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="muted">{{config.coinsPerYuan}}金币演示换算1元</text
        ><text>打开钱包 →</text></view
      ></view
    ><view class="stats"
      ><view class="stat"
        ><view class="stat-value">{{user.earnedToday}}</view
        ><view class="caption">今日入账 / 金币</view></view
      ><view class="stat"
        ><view class="stat-value">{{user.adsToday}} / {{user.dailyLimit}}</view
        ><view class="caption">完成任务 / 上限</view></view
      ><view class="stat"
        ><view class="stat-value">{{user.frozen}}</view
        ><view class="caption">申请冻结 / 金币</view></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="title">每日签到</text
        ><text class="pill"
          >{{config.signinBase}}＋{{config.subsidyCoins}}金币</text
        ></view
      ><view class="muted">完成签到激励任务后入账，每个业务日限领一次。</view
      ><view class="week"
        ><view wx:for="{{user.week}}" wx:key="day" class="day"
          ><view class="day-coin {{item.signed ? 'active' : ''}}"
            >{{item.signed ? '✓' : item.dayNumber}}</view
          ><text>{{item.label}}</text></view
        ></view
      ><button
        class="button"
        data-kind="signin"
        bindtap="claim"
        disabled="{{busy || !canSignin}}"
      >
        {{user.signedToday ? '今日已签到' : config.adProvider === 'demo' ?
        '模拟签到，领取金币' : '真实广告尚未接入'}}
      </button></view
    ><view class="shortcuts"
      ><view class="shortcut" bindtap="group"
        ><image src="/assets/packet.png" mode="aspectFit" /><text>红包群</text
        ><view class="caption">两分钟继续叠包</view></view
      ><view class="shortcut" bindtap="bag"
        ><image src="/assets/bag.png" mode="aspectFit" /><text>幸运福袋</text
        ><view class="caption">每分钟一次机会</view></view
      ><view class="shortcut" bindtap="invite"
        ><image src="/assets/chest.png" mode="aspectFit" /><text>邀请好友</text
        ><view class="caption">单层关系记录</view></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card art-card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="title">红包群正在等你</text
        ><text class="pill">可叠至{{config.packetCap}}</text></view
      ><image class="art" src="/assets/packet.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view
        class="muted"
        >先看金额，觉得少可以暂存，继续等待下一轮。已累计金额有预算预留。</view
      ><button class="button" bindtap="group">进入欢乐红包群 →</button></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="title">最近金币动态</text
        ><text class="link" bindtap="records">全部流水 →</text></view
      ><view wx:if="{{!ledger.length}}" class="empty"
        >还没有金币记录，完成任务后显示真实开发流水。</view
      ><view wx:for="{{ledger}}" wx:key="id" class="list-item"
        ><view class="row"
          ><text>{{item.title}}</text
          ><text class="amount">{{item.delta}}</text></view
        ><view class="caption">{{item.time}}</view></view
      ></view
    ></block
  ><view class="footer">悦享金币 · 元享式玩法独立开发版</view></view
>
